00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.280
I always do the top and then make a little hat.

445
00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:11.040
Yep.

446
00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:15.420
Well, growing up, my family cut off the top of the pumpkin.

447
00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:15.920
Yeah.

448
00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.360
That was our way.

449
00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.080
I continued to do it that way in my adult life.

