472
00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.120
You just set the candle on the ground.

473
00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:25.740
Brunch with Babs.

474
00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:26.560
Wowzers.

475
00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:31.200
